Peter,

I grew up in a manufacturing family.

We sweat for the paychecks and earned the calluses on our hands.

But today, the deck is stacked against working people who make things here in America.

Inflation, outsourcing, crushing taxes &mdash; politicians like Eric Sorensen don&rsquo;t care. It&rsquo;s never their jobs on the chopping block.

But I say, enough!

I&rsquo;m ready to get to Congress so we can look out for hard working. In Congress, I&rsquo;ll crack down on China, cut taxes, and invest in skilled trades.

But to get there, I need your support.

